{
  "uid": "infra",
  "title": "Infraestrutura das VMs",
  "description": "CPU, memória, rede, disco e carga das três VMs (Node Exporter).",
  "tags": [
    "monitoramento-nginx"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "5s",
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m"
    ]
  },
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Estado dos alvos",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": [],
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Estado dos 6 alvos (up)",
      "description": "up = 1 quando a última coleta do Prometheus naquele exporter funcionou; 0 quando falhou. Uma caixa por alvo (VM + tipo de exporter).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "text": {
          "titleSize": 16,
          "valueSize": 18
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "up",
          "legendFormat": "{{vm}} · {{job}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Recursos por VM",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "panels": [],
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Uso de CPU (%)",
      "description": "rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[1m]) = fração do tempo que cada núcleo ficou ocioso no último minuto. avg by (vm) faz a média dos núcleos de cada VM; 1 - ocioso = ocupado; × 100 = porcentagem.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^lb( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#8F8F8F"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^srv-a( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#3274D9"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^srv-b( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#FF9830"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (1 - avg by (vm) (rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{vm}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "id": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memória utilizada (%)",
      "description": "MemAvailable = memória que ainda pode ser usada sem swap; MemTotal = total. 1 - disponível/total = fração usada; × 100 = porcentagem.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^lb( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#8F8F8F"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^srv-a( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#3274D9"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^srv-b( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#FF9830"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (1 - node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes)",
          "legendFormat": "{{vm}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "id": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tráfego de rede na host-only (enp0s8)",
      "description": "Os contadores node_network_*_bytes_total só crescem; rate(...[1m]) converte em bytes por segundo (média do último minuto). Filtro device=enp0s8: placa host-only, por onde passa todo o tráfego do projeto. Valores de recebimento e transmissão por VM.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 12
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^lb( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#8F8F8F"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^srv-a( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#3274D9"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^srv-b( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#FF9830"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rate(node_network_receive_bytes_total{device=\"enp0s8\"}[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{vm}} recebido",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rate(node_network_transmit_bytes_total{device=\"enp0s8\"}[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{vm}} transmitido",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "id": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Carga média de 1 minuto (node_load1)",
      "description": "Média de processos rodando ou esperando CPU no último minuto. Com 1 vCPU, valor acima de 1 significa fila: a VM está sobrecarregada.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 12
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^lb( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#8F8F8F"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^srv-a( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#3274D9"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^srv-b( .*)?$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#FF9830"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_load1",
          "legendFormat": "{{vm}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "id": 7
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Disco raiz (/): espaço total e disponível",
      "description": "node_filesystem_size_bytes = tamanho total do sistema de arquivos; node_filesystem_avail_bytes = espaço livre que um usuário comum pode usar. Filtro mountpoint=\"/\": disco principal de cada VM.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#73BF69"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*total$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#8F8F8F"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "valueMode": "color",
        "namePlacement": "left",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_filesystem_size_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{vm}} total",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{vm}} disponível",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "id": 8
    }
  ]
}